pagination:
  data: iocIndex.indicator_redirects
  size: 1
  alias: moved
permalink: "/indicators/{{ moved.from }}/"
layout: layouts/redirect.njk
eleventyComputed:
  title: "Indicator moved"
  redirect_to: "/indicators/{{ moved.to | safe }}/"
eleventyExcludeFromCollections: true
---
{#
  src/indicators/redirects.njk — stubs for indicator pages that were merged or retyped

  An indicator page's address carries its type. When a value filed under two
  types becomes one page, or a page is retyped by hand, the old address keeps
  a stub that sends the reader on, the same way src/hunts/redirects.njk does
  for merged hunts. iocIndex.indicator_redirects lists the {from, to} id
  pairs. The repository indicators renamed in September 2026 are not here:
  there are about 2,450 of them, so they are one map read by the 404 page
  (src/indicator-moved.njk).
#}
